                        ],
                        "form": "подло́дках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c98ba8c5-0736-3d8f-9700-bff73cca84e7",
                        "entry_id": "6fa69adf-db93-3a36-a7d0-af5ce37e432f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "воен., разг. то же, что подводная лодка; корабль, способный совершать плавание и выполнять боевые задачи в подводном или надводном положении"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b99ab37-7344-4cd5-ac6e-2763dce55d22",
                                "sense_id": "c98ba8c5-0736-3d8f-9700-bff73cca84e7",
                                "text": "Вчера в 20 кабельтовых от Гайнаша прошла в подводном состоянии неприятельская подлодка."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c872d5ca-07fd-45f4-9886-627f034cc588",
                                "sense_id": "c98ba8c5-0736-3d8f-9700-bff73cca84e7",
                                "text": "20 лет назад — 12 августа 2000 года — в Баренцевом море потерпела крушение и затонула российская атомная подлодка «Курск». Все находившиеся на борту 118 членов экипажа погибли. О том, что привело к катастрофе, ставшей крупнейшей в истории российского военно-морского флота, и о том, что изменилось за 20 лет, прошедших с гибели «Курска», — в спецпроекте Настоящего Времени."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "56b5dd2d-27a2-4fa3-943c-ec67304e2a3b",
                        "source_entry_id": "6fa69adf-db93-3a36-a7d0-af5ce37e432f",
                        "source_sense_id": "c98ba8c5-0736-3d8f-9700-bff73cca84e7",
                        "target_lang_word": "submarine",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "submarine",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c83c30a-45a1-329d-bb58-a6e82914871e",
                                        "entry_id": "0928731b-b5c8-3229-b36f-80a12ff62ec6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Being, relating to, or made for use underwater, especially beneath the sea."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a01f5a13-aac8-41b3-aaee-a57a47d39452",
                                                "sense_id": "1c83c30a-45a1-329d-bb58-a6e82914871e",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: submerged (synonymous in \"being underwater\" sense)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "813d618b-553b-415a-a668-3756a0d0e18b",
                                                "sense_id": "1c83c30a-45a1-329d-bb58-a6e82914871e",
                                                "text": "[…] a Chorus of Sea-nymphs, who[…] arrive, in a winged car, from the submarine palace of their father Oceanus."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3343b1b2-fff2-3055-8acf-9a4cb61b31c4",
                                        "entry_id": "0928731b-b5c8-3229-b36f-80a12ff62ec6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hidden or undisclosed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b618dc4-5d82-482b-a215-88b1fbdf452a",
                                                "sense_id": "3343b1b2-fff2-3055-8acf-9a4cb61b31c4",
                                                "text": "a submarine patent"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a7ec44e-0de6-3c4a-a704-4bd145d8bbd3",
                                        "entry_id": "0928731b-b5c8-3229-b36f-80a12ff62ec6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a pitch, thrown with the hand lower than the elbow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "414e3332-c086-429b-bd8a-4856b44d1a58",
                                                "sense_id": "4a7ec44e-0de6-3c4a-a704-4bd145d8bbd3",
                                                "text": "When Peterson saw the unusual pitching motion of Kent Tekulve—the submarine pitcher who threw baseballs as though they were coming right out of the rubber slab on the mound—he was the first of many who tried to change Tekulve's delivery."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "submarine",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "733a7e84-c1ad-377f-862d-2f1d3beb7cf1",
                                        "entry_id": "e2b6d325-f091-36a8-b74f-e7c98ed2100d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A boat that can go underwater."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c03c4e4-ae4f-4659-8a5c-4a934d2291bf",
                                                "sense_id": "733a7e84-c1ad-377f-862d-2f1d3beb7cf1",
                                                "text": "Me: *staring out window* looks like rain\nSubmarine captain: what\nMe: but like more"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da2c610a-9cfc-3ba4-a576-59a6c519ec0e",
                                        "entry_id": "e2b6d325-f091-36a8-b74f-e7c98ed2100d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A kind of sandwich made in a long loaf of bread."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "539d05bd-358b-32c1-a89b-27b7bccde76e",
                                        "entry_id": "e2b6d325-f091-36a8-b74f-e7c98ed2100d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pitch delivered with an underhand motion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bab4bcd-2c47-3838-9a2b-2d7bc7a57fbe",
                                        "entry_id": "e2b6d325-f091-36a8-b74f-e7c98ed2100d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any submarine plant or animal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b86185fb-f021-37e3-93cd-89be6da6f444",
                                        "entry_id": "e2b6d325-f091-36a8-b74f-e7c98ed2100d",
